        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="cp2000-row-alt">
            <td>IRS Notice CP2000 Official Understanding Guide</td>
            <td>Automated Underreporter (AUR) rules, 30-day response timelines, and dispute instructions</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.irs.gov/individuals/understanding-your-cp2000-notice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">irs.gov CP2000 Guide</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>IRS Publication 5181 — Tax Return Reviews &amp; CP2000 Notices</td>
            <td>Required documentation for disputing missing 1099-R rollovers and 1099-B cost basis</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/p5181.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRS Publication 5181 (PDF)</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="cp2000-row-alt">
            <td>Internal Revenue Manual (IRM) 4.19.3 — Automated Underreporter Program</td>
            <td>Official IRS internal processing procedures for evaluating CP2000 response letters and evidence</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.irs.gov/irm/part4/irm_04-019-003r" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRM 4.19.3 Manual</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="cp2000-independence">Seniors Audit is an independent educational platform. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Internal Revenue Service or any government agency. All calculations use official IRS rules and published rates. We do not receive payment for referrals, leads, or any action taken by visitors to this site.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ELEMENT 8 — FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="cp2000-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <FAQBlock items={faqs} />
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ELEMENT 9 — RELATED TOOLS
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="cp2000-section" aria-labelledby="related-tools-heading">
    <h2 id="related-tools-heading">Other Free Tax Tools You May Find Useful</h2>
    
    <div class="cp2000-related-grid">
      <a href="/tools/irs-cp14-notice-decoder/" class="cp2000-related-card">
